<title>UK: Norddeutsche Hypo has 100 mln mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Hypo has 100 mln mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE HYPOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    02.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **PAYS 81 PERCENT OF 10-YEAR REX YIELD SUB-INDEX,</p>
<p>		SET AT 5.50 percent FOR FIRST YEAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
